        "type": "official",
        "checkedAt": "2026-07-31"
      },
      "notes": "Official embassy factsheet states ordinary passport numbering prefixes MWAxxxxxx for 36 pages and MWZxxxxxx for 48 pages. Values are synthetic and not registry-validated."
